{"id":"n66892-1-9","stage":5,"title":"아이디 · 账号","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66892-1-9-1","ko":"오랜만에 인터넷 사이트에 들어가려니까 제 아이디를 잊어버렸어요.","zh":"好久没登录网站了，我把自己的账号给忘了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"인터넷","meaning":"互联网","explanation":"인터넷：互联网。","readings":[{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70774","senseId":"1","lemma":"인터넷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}},{"text":"사이트에","meaning":"网站","explanation":"사이트：网站；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이트","audio":"/audio/b2c8d45cf4a07057a749.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61229","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이트에","audio":"/audio/f50fb0f2eb99eb30b435.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가려니까","meaning":"进入，转入","explanation":"들어가다：进入，转入；려니까：说明正要或打算做某事时所遇到的情况、想法或困难。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"3","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가려니까","audio":"/audio/5911a7dcf20bf41d172c.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"아이디를","meaning":"账号，用户名，网名","explanation":"아이디：账号，用户名，网名；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이디","audio":"/audio/367001d737437f4ca006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66892","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이디를","audio":"/audio/5af790da113974660d63.mp3"}},{"text":"잊어버렸어요.","meaning":"忘掉","explanation":"잊어버리다：忘掉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잊어버리다","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89801","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잊어버렸어요","audio":"/audio/9d3562abdca8d431ff8d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"020698f8f7c78429","term":"인터넷","zh":"互联网","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3","entryId":"70774","definition":"连接全世界的电脑使其可以互相交换信息的巨大电脑通信网。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b2c8d45cf4a07057","term":"사이트","zh":"网站","audio":"/audio/b2c8d45cf4a07057a749.mp3","entryId":"61229","definition":"可供网络使用者随时上网并储存有信息的地方。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进入，转入","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"开始新的状态或时期。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"367001d737437f4c","term":"아이디","zh":"账号，用户名，网名","audio":"/audio/367001d737437f4ca006.mp3","entryId":"66892","definition":"在网络里显示用户身份的文字或数字等。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5a16c9c25daf9c4e","term":"잊어버리다","zh":"忘掉","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3","entryId":"89801","definition":"本来知道的事情记不住或记不起来。","pronunciation":["이저버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/523ec6408c074b0e4bdf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66892-1-9-2","ko":"아이디 찾기 버튼을 눌러서 아이디를 찾아보세요.","zh":"请点击‘查找账号’按钮来试试找回账号。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이디","meaning":"账号，用户名，网名","explanation":"아이디：账号，用户名，网名。","readings":[{"term":"아이디","audio"